Subject: [PATCH 6/8] feat: TGeoManager::Export writes the geometry as GDML
 ROOT's reader reads

Worker 6's commit, plus the module it left untracked in its worktree
(pyroot/geom/gdmlwrite.py and its test) - the commit's manager.Export imports it, so the
tree was broken without it. export_* now has a writer to run against;
